#: scenario2:scenario2_E78553CD_4C95_4319_A3B1_62E2A964DE0C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21e7cc1cec7decb168a10251d283ce5183f480f7d021297cb12798732a69ce74
