msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫One taste and you never forget it.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’d like to bring the entire cuisine back with "
"me if I could."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫한 입 먹으면 잊질 못 하겠어.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫기왕이면 요리째로 챙겨 가고 싶은데……."

#: scenario2:scenario2_CB4A3C35_AE7C_42D8_97AB_998B740FD2DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 35e6f9e166dce8f24404362e0a9e31786011c6dd545f86ab665541baaaa4582d
