msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What, would you prefer we discuss the mundane?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Why don’t we talk about market "
"developments and our spices inventory?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫속 막히는 화제가 더 좋았어?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫이쪽 정세가 어쩌니―― 향신료는 충분하냐느니 ⟪k:3⟫같은 거."

