#: scenario2:scenario2_48688F6C_4A2D_4F6F_8035_0F50B05DBDCA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9561eb740fa5133104dc396d18b35184182d3e85047acd597bd9d48b395d736a
