msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My parents’ relationship is on thin ice, but the air feels like it’s on fire. ⟪k:1⟫It’s much "
"too hot."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫엄마랑 아빠는 쌀쌀하게 싸우는데, ⟪k:1⟫날씨는 땡볕. ⟪k:2⟫너무 덥다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_9E8AA447_803D_4FF2_867B_0D87BF0DBCA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7140594bf7af6e2650f92ec6dbf0b882b760f525cd1f2eb5edf57b49d484f879
